# Profile photos: crop + white background

Whenever importing or saving student/staff profile pictures:

1. Crop to a head-and-shoulders ID portrait (3:4, keep the top of the head/cap).
2. Place the person on a **pure white** background.
3. Save as JPEG under `assets/images/profile`.
4. Do not copy raw ceremony/scene photos as-is.

Use `save_profile_photo_white_bg()` / `ProfilePhotoNormalizer` (AI isolation when an API key is available, GD crop onto white always). Apply this to every Wisdom child-school import going forward.
